        "created_at": "2020-03-04T04:40:34.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>This was really interesting to think about!</p>\n<p>It would be easy to put Legacy with Wellspring, but I’m not sure if he would be more on the Preservation side. OTOH, the idea of him being Progress and Beacon going Preservation is rather...delicious :D</p>\n<p>Original Ra&nbsp;I can see going Glory (or maybe even Chaos), Thiago Ra I’m not as sure of.</p>\n<p>Vertex Tachyon is an easy Chaos pick haha!</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
