; Chaos would work better than anything else for him (and we don't have many other good Chaos candidates).</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Omnitron... doesn't really have a personality.&nbsp; It wants to progress&nbsp;<em>itself</em>&nbsp;but doesn't have any overarching ideals.&nbsp; It could be Conquest.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Now, all that said--even if there is a conversion kit, nothing says the heroes have to be on predetermined teams.&nbsp; They have to work mechanically, they don't necessarily have to fit into the story.&nbsp; And they could be alternate reality versions, not from Mist Storm.</p>",
