      {
        "id": 229000,
        "name": "liarliar",
        "username": "liarliar",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/liarliar/{size}/1951_2.png",
        "created_at": "2020-04-03T23:30:06.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Oh, I definitely agree about Wraith going Conquest - F6 Wraith is basically there anyway, so I can easily see that happening in the Vertex-verse.</p>\n<p>You’re Very right on Proletariat, too. I don’t think he would be idealogically in favour of Chaos, but he could easily be duped into fighting on their side. On the other hand, I think he has the ideals of Progress? And it would be cool character development to see him doing something because *he* wants to, not because someone else told him. Also it could be fun for him to be on a ‘hero’ team, but still opposed to AZ.</p>\n<p>Ambuscade is absolutely Chaos and I’m sad about it.</p>\n<p>Dawn is so Conquest that she’d try to take it over!</p>\n<p>And Legacy/Blade teamups will always be great - the fact that this one looks much longer-term than things like OblivAeon? *chef kiss*</p>",
